Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousands of Agent ID holders hunt free mints on BSC.\NBut free is often a trap — a live owner, a hidden fee, a fake free lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.05,0:00:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Every candidate is a tombstone, vetted live on-chain.\NMOSSMINDS: fifty out of a hundred — RISKY.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.45,0:00:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Paste any contract and the sentinel digs it up on the spot.\NRead-only static calls. It never sends a transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.42,0:01:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A patrol re-vets everything every five minutes.\NThe same engine is an MCP server — any agent can call vet_mint.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.81,0:01:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Built spec-driven, the Kiro way: requirements, design, tasks.\NGraveyard Shift: don't trust a free mint. Make the sentinel dig first.
